  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4301.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to manage and administer oil discharge and pollution control licensing and the collection of the oil discharge and disposal fund fees established under RSA 146-A:11-b.\n\nSource. #5792, eff 2-24-94; ss by #7199, INTERIM, eff 2-24-00, EXPIRES: 6-23-00; ss by #7219, eff 3-29-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-08\n\nNew. #9376, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10026, eff 11-16-11; ss by #13037, eff 4-20-20\n\nNew. #13037, eff 4-20-20",
